    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/d8fe0592fe425e09c566fd272310d759.webp?t=1753939614\" width=610 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[AFANTASIA]</strong> is a surreal exploration game that follows a boy struggling with his sense of identity in his hometown:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<i><strong>Tempo</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/881fcdc7b3024a5a50039ead33779c65.poster.avif?t=1753939614\" width=610 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/881fcdc7b3024a5a50039ead33779c65.webm?t=1753939614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/e086891c35f5f469d67a42c054d9bdce.poster.avif?t=1753939614\" width=600 height=574 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/e086891c35f5f469d67a42c054d9bdce.webm?t=1753939614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an <strong>atmospheric point-and-click adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/adb4bb8925119efc3c6276fad2f30b4b.poster.avif?t=1753939614\" width=600 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/adb4bb8925119efc3c6276fad2f30b4b.webm?t=1753939614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>surreal</strong> environments and shape the protagonist's path in this <strong>philosophical</strong> and <strong>cinematic narrative</strong> that invites you to question <strong>reality</strong> and uncover hidden truths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/235edcf813b2332b94b7df319e35d956.poster.avif?t=1753939614\" width=600 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/235edcf813b2332b94b7df319e35d956.webm?t=1753939614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into <strong>memories</strong> and talk to the townsfolk, experiencing <strong>varied gameplay</strong> styles\u2014all brought to life with <strong>stylized pixel art</strong> and a beautiful <strong>dithering</strong> effect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/d8fe0592fe425e09c566fd272310d759.webp?t=1753939614\" width=610 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/f4b46bd8019a630d871617c481615374.poster.avif?t=1753939614\" width=610 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/f4b46bd8019a630d871617c481615374.webm?t=1753939614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/0bf51e61bcb475aac0b7e261db470c44.avif?t=1753939614\" width=610 height=250 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/d8fe0592fe425e09c566fd272310d759.webp?t=1753939614\" width=610 height=50 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/d8fe0592fe425e09c566fd272310d759.webp?t=1753939614\" width=610 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[AFANTASIA]</strong> is a surreal exploration game that follows a boy struggling with his sense of identity in his hometown:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<i><strong>Tempo</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/881fcdc7b3024a5a50039ead33779c65.poster.avif?t=1753939614\" width=610 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/881fcdc7b3024a5a50039ead33779c65.webm?t=1753939614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/e086891c35f5f469d67a42c054d9bdce.poster.avif?t=1753939614\" width=600 height=574 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/e086891c35f5f469d67a42c054d9bdce.webm?t=1753939614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an <strong>atmospheric point-and-click adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"