ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/f4b46bd8019a630d871617c481615374.poster.avif?t=1753939614\" width=610 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/f4b46bd8019a630d871617c481615374.webm?t=1753939614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/0bf51e61bcb475aac0b7e261db470c44.avif?t=1753939614\" width=610 height=250 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/d8fe0592fe425e09c566fd272310d759.webp?t=1753939614\" width=610 height=50 /></span></p>",
